  "factor_name": "Downside-breadth-gated residual reversal (10-day)",
  "version": "1.0",
  "calculation": {
    "expression": "rolling_mean_3((-asset_residual_return_10d) * clip(1 + 2*(0.5 - lagged_breadth_20d), 0.5, 1.5))",
    "description": "Compute each asset's log return residual against the contemporaneous cross-asset mean, reverse its lagged 10-session cumulative residual return, and scale it more strongly after broad market weakness. Breadth is the lagged fraction of the 15 assets with positive 20-session returns; all predictors are lagged before the forward 10-day test. Smooth the signal over three sessions."
  },
